# Build context exclusions for workers/runner/Dockerfile. BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile.
# Keeps secrets, local state, caches and the web app's build output out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
.git
.mail
.cache
.claude
.hallmark
.taste-skill
.github
storage
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
e2e
docs
design-system
